protocol/  and  network/
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Bedrock protocol codecs and the RakNet/NetherNet transports.

  Originally:  CloudburstMC Protocol   https://github.com/CloudburstMC/Protocol
  Forked from: Kas-tle/Protocol        https://github.com/Kas-tle/Protocol
               Kas-tle/Network         https://github.com/Kas-tle/Network
  Licence:     Apache License 2.0 (see protocol/LICENSE and network/LICENSE)

These are vendored rather than depended on because this repository's copies
differ substantially from upstream. As required by section 4(b) of the Apache
License, the modifications carried here are:

  * Added hand-written Bedrock codecs for protocol versions 924 (1.26.0),
    944 (1.26.10), 975 (1.26.20), 1001 (1.26.30), 2168
    (1.26.40/1.26.44), and 2192 (1.26.50), each with the packet serializers
    those releases changed. Upstream did not cover these versions.

  * Corrected serializers where a version's wire format was wrong or absent,
    including StartGame, LevelChunk, SubChunk, PlayerAuthInput, CraftingData,
    CreativeContent, ItemStackRequest, PlayerList and the entity-data type maps.

  * Fixed a direct-memory leak in SubChunkData: the render height map retained a
    slice that was never released, leaking 256 bytes per sub-chunk carrying one.

  * Removed upstream modules and sources this project does not use.

Protocol 2192 and the protocol-2168 1.26.44 dialect were independently
implemented after reviewing these Apache-2.0-licensed protocol references:

  EndstoneMC/bedrock-protocol
  https://github.com/EndstoneMC/bedrock-protocol
